WEBVTT

00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:15.156
[wolves howling]

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:21.871
Crash, I'm starting to think.
克拉什 我想到一件事

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.956
Oh, no. Now you're doing it too.
不会吧 你也开始思考了

00:00:24.498 --> 00:00:25.958
When we left the herd,
我们离开家时

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:29.378
we swore we'd become independent
and make our mark.
曾发誓要独立生活 在世上留名

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.923
-Yeah, but how?
-[snoring]
对 但要怎么做呢

00:00:32.006 --> 00:00:35.009
Buck needs some shut-eye
and we're nocturnal.
巴克要睡觉 而我们却是夜行动物

00:00:35.092 --> 00:00:38.930
This is our chance to prove ourselves.
Follow my lead.
这是我们证明自己的机会 跟我来

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.390
Hmm. [yells]

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.475
[thud]

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.352
[continues snoring]

00:00:45.436 --> 00:00:48.147
Okay, Lost Lagoon is due south.
好 失落之湖在南边

00:00:48.231 --> 00:00:49.815
We have to turn this boat around.
我们得调转船头才行

00:00:49.899 --> 00:00:51.776
You're holding the map upside down.
你把地图拿反了

00:00:51.859 --> 00:00:53.277
Oh, well, in that case, we're good!
那就万事大吉啦

00:00:53.361 --> 00:00:55.404
-We're doing it! High five!
-[both yell]
我们拿出行动啦 击个掌

00:00:58.282 --> 00:01:00.993
Oh. When is tea ready, Mum?
茶泡好了吗 妈妈

00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:05.039
[exclaims, snores]

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.880
[creaking]

00:01:14.423 --> 00:01:15.466
[grunts]

00:01:16.717 --> 00:01:18.010
[snoring]

00:01:20.137 --> 00:01:21.973
-[Crash] Buck?
-[Eddie] Buck?
-巴克
-巴克

00:01:22.056 --> 00:01:23.266
[Crash] Buck?
巴克

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.768
[both imitating chickens]
Buck? Buck? Buck, Buck, Buck,
巴克

00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:28.145
Buck, Buck, Buck,
Buck, Buck, Buck, Buck, Buck,
巴克

00:01:28.229 --> 00:01:29.355
-Buck!
-[yells]
巴克

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:30.565
Did I drift off?
我不小心睡着了？

00:01:31.148 --> 00:01:33.401
It's all good, Buck.
We kept the boat on track
没事的 巴克 我们让船保持了航向

00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:36.153
and made you a delicious a-breakfast.
还为你准备了美味的早餐

00:01:36.237 --> 00:01:39.031
You got these from the trees?
这是你们从树上摘的？

00:01:39.115 --> 00:01:40.241
-Mmm.
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:40.324 --> 00:01:44.370
That's very nice,
but they're also very poisonous.
你们的好意我心领了
但这些果子有剧毒

00:01:44.453 --> 00:01:47.290
From now on, keep your paws
and tails inside the boat.
从现在起 把你们的爪子和尾巴
都乖乖留在船内

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.833
You don't know what's out there.
你们不知道外面有什么危险

00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.836
Oh, so maybe we shouldn't have
snagged these jump ropes.
那我们或许本不该顺手抓来这两根跳绳的

00:01:51.919 --> 00:01:53.671
-[snakes hiss, rattle]
-Uh. [chuckles]

00:01:53.754 --> 00:01:56.799
Guys, those are more poisonous
than the berries.
伙计们 那东西比果子还要毒

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.426
-We're immune to snake venom.
-[hisses]
我们不怕蛇毒

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:01.178
Yeah, but I'm not. It would kill me.
但我怕 蛇毒会让我一命呜呼

00:02:01.262 --> 00:02:04.473
It would make me break out
and then kill me.
我会先起疹子 然后一命呜呼

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:05.600
Our bad.
我们错了

00:02:06.517 --> 00:02:07.768
Sorry, Zsa Zsa.
对不起 扎扎

00:02:09.145 --> 00:02:12.398
Should we not have
adopted these cute pet lizards either?
那我们是不是也不该
收留这两只可爱的宠物小蜥蜴？

00:02:17.028 --> 00:02:18.654
Maybe we're not ready to prove ourselves.
或许我们还没准备好证明自己

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.781
Ha! Speak for yourself.
哼 是说你自己吧

00:02:25.161 --> 00:02:26.871
Okay, you can speak for both of us.
好吧 说的是我们俩

00:02:41.677 --> 00:02:45.389
We've made it!
Time to summon an old friend.
成功到达 该呼唤一位老朋友了

00:02:46.015 --> 00:02:47.725
[plays note]

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:52.355
[snarling]

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.024
[thudding]

00:02:58.736 --> 00:03:01.948
[roars]

00:03:02.698 --> 00:03:05.034
Crash, it's Mama T. rex!
克拉什 是霸王龙妈妈

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:07.286
Wait, you know Mama T?
等等 你们认识霸王龙妈妈？

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.081
Uh-huh. Our friend Sid
used to babysit her kids.
是啊 我们的朋友希德曾帮她带过孩子

00:03:10.164 --> 00:03:12.542
She's gonna help us take out Orson.
她会帮我们打败奥森

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:17.421
Well, that totally makes sense.
She's 15 tons of deadly, vicious terror!
太有道理了
她可是15吨重的致命凶器 让人胆战心惊

00:03:18.172 --> 00:03:20.049
No offense, Mama. [shouts]
没有冒犯的意思 妈妈

00:03:23.261 --> 00:03:24.679
What's wrong, girl?
怎么了 丫头

00:03:24.762 --> 00:03:25.930
[groans]

00:03:26.013 --> 00:03:29.892
Toothache, huh? Come on.
Let Dr. Buck take a look.
牙疼吗 来 让巴克医生瞧瞧

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:38.150
Left upper incisor impacted.
Lower right molar missing.
左上门牙阻生 右下磨牙缺失

00:03:38.776 --> 00:03:40.653
Ah! There's the bad tooth.
蛀牙在这里

00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:43.197
Yeah, I've got to 86 the 23.
好 我得把第23颗牙齿拔掉

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:47.201
That's what happens, young lady,
when you don't floss.
小姑娘 不好好清洁牙缝就会这样

00:03:47.285 --> 00:03:49.078
Which is why we use our tails.
所以我们用自己的尾巴

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.790
Well, how can she help us defeat Orson
with a bad tooth?
她有蛀牙还怎么帮我们打败奥森呢

00:03:52.873 --> 00:03:54.250
[Buck] That is a good question.
这个问题问得好

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:57.587
-I'm gonna need to pull it. Oi!
-[growls]
我得把蛀牙拔出来

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:04.510
Well, if you're not going to let me help,
I guess I'll have to just give up.
要是你不让我帮忙 那我就没办法了

00:04:13.227 --> 00:04:16.105
[roars]

00:04:18.149 --> 00:04:19.150
[thuds]

00:04:19.233 --> 00:04:21.652
Whoa! Respect.
厉害

00:04:23.195 --> 00:04:24.906
[grunting]

00:04:27.116 --> 00:04:28.367
Hurry.
抓紧时间

00:04:28.451 --> 00:04:30.328
I'm performing surgery here.
我在做手术呢

00:04:30.411 --> 00:04:33.998
If I let go, she'll surgically remove
your top from your bottom.
如果我放手 她会让你的脑袋搬家

00:04:34.081 --> 00:04:35.458
Boy, it's really in there. [grunts]
这牙根好深

00:04:37.793 --> 00:04:40.254
Okay, Zee. All done. Time to wake her up.
好了 小Z 大功告成 该把她叫醒了

00:04:40.338 --> 00:04:43.090
I just knock 'em out. I don't wake 'em up.
我只会熏晕 不会叫醒

00:04:43.174 --> 00:04:45.051
[snarling]

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:47.386
Incoming! We've got raptors!
有情况 猛龙来了

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.639
Come on, boys! Let's get her up.
快点 小伙子们 把她叫醒

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:51.390
We need to call in reinforcements.
我们得去搬救兵

00:04:51.474 --> 00:04:53.351
She is the reinforcements!
她就是救兵

00:04:54.101 --> 00:04:55.811
Hello? Anyone home?
喂 家里有人吗？

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:57.939
You can sleep when you're dead!
要睡觉等死了再睡

00:04:58.022 --> 00:04:59.148
Why'd you knock her out?
你把她熏晕做什么？

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:00.316
You told me to.
是你让我熏的

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:01.776
-No, I didn't.
-You winked.
-不 我没有
-你使眼色了

00:05:01.859 --> 00:05:04.528
I only have one eye.
Technically, that's a blink.
我只有一只眼 除了眨眼哪能使什么眼色

00:05:04.612 --> 00:05:06.113
[snarling]

00:05:06.197 --> 00:05:09.116
-Nap time's over.
-What did you have, bricks for lunch?
-该起床啦
-你午饭吃砖了吗

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.368
[Zee shouts]

00:05:10.451 --> 00:05:12.536
Well, here goes nothing.
只能如此了

00:05:13.955 --> 00:05:15.248
Heads up, buttercup.
当心 甜心

00:05:16.624 --> 00:05:17.708
[Zee] Go, go, go!
快跑！

00:05:18.876 --> 00:05:21.546
[roars]

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:27.843
[slow clapping]

00:05:29.804 --> 00:05:31.889
Oh, you're pathetic, Buck.
你真可悲 巴克

00:05:31.973 --> 00:05:34.850
Did you really think reuniting with Zee
难道你真以为和小Z重聚

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:38.896
and recruiting some T. rex
could help you defeat my army?
再找一只霸王龙当帮手
就能战胜我的大军？

00:05:42.733 --> 00:05:44.193
[snarling]

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.327
[raptors squeal]

00:05:57.081 --> 00:05:59.000
[thuds]

00:05:59.083 --> 00:06:01.085
Well, that was the idea. Yes.
本来是这么打算的 没错

00:06:01.168 --> 00:06:04.630
Evidently, I miscalculated,
but nobody's perfect.
显然 我失算了 但人无完人嘛

00:06:04.714 --> 00:06:09.552
Except me, that is. I'm a genius
who's about to rule the Lost World.
除了我 本天才即将成为失落世界的主宰

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:11.554
Over our dead bodies!
除非从我们的尸体上跨过去

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:16.684
My plan exactly. Soon everyone
will bow to me and call me king.
我正有此意 很快
所有人都会向我俯首称臣 尊我为王

00:06:17.393 --> 00:06:18.811
Excuse me. Mm-hmm.
你搞什么

00:06:18.895 --> 00:06:21.355
I'm trying to do my evil here!
我在扮恶人呢

00:06:21.439 --> 00:06:23.441
I'm on a bit of a roll.
正扮得很顺的说

00:06:23.524 --> 00:06:26.319
But enough of this discourse.
不过 狠话就说到这里

00:06:26.402 --> 00:06:29.030
Let the feeding frenzy begin!
开始吃大餐吧

00:06:31.741 --> 00:06:33.200
[Orson chuckles]

00:06:33.284 --> 00:06:34.869
[snarling]

00:06:35.703 --> 00:06:37.121
[screams]

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.461
Buck!
巴克

00:06:48.216 --> 00:06:49.550
[gasps]

00:06:50.885 --> 00:06:52.637
[cackling]

00:06:56.515 --> 00:06:58.643
Get away! Get away! Down!
走开 下去

00:07:00.603 --> 00:07:02.230
Spray 'em, Zee!
放屁熏他们 小Z

00:07:02.313 --> 00:07:05.733
I just sprayed!
I need time to refill, okay?
我刚放过了 积攒下一个需要时间好吗

00:07:05.816 --> 00:07:07.860
Ooh! TMI, dude.
不用说那么详细 姐们

00:07:19.872 --> 00:07:21.123
[Eddie shouting]

